   "Proposes RoTAF: five trust dimensions and four accountability mechanisms (product liability, professional accountability, incident investigation, certification).",
   "Introduces the Trust-Accountability Quality Score (TAQS) across six robot deployment contexts.",
   "Eldercare robots score lowest (0.484) due to dignity and emotional dependency concerns; no specific EU framework exists.",
